* Boost Converter - 12V to 24V @ 500kHz
.title Boost Converter

* --- Power Stage ---
* Inductor: input node (1) to switch node (2)
L1 1 2 10u IC=0

* MOSFET Switch (ideal behavioral switch)
S1 2 0 gate 0 MYSW
.model MYSW SW(Ron=0.01 Roff=1Meg Vt=2.5 Vh=0.5)

* Freewheeling Diode: switch node (2) to output (3)
D1 2 3 MYDIODE
.model MYDIODE D(Is=1n Rs=0.01 n=1)

* Output Capacitor
C1 3 0 100u IC=24

* Load Resistor (24V / 1A = 24 Ohm)
Rload 3 0 24

* --- Sources ---
* Input voltage source: 12V DC
Vin 1 0 DC 12V

* PWM gate drive: 500kHz, 50% duty cycle
* PULSE(V_low V_high T_delay T_rise T_fall T_on T_period)
Vgate gate 0 PULSE(0 5 0 10n 10n 1u 2u)

* --- Simulation ---
.tran 0 200u 0 10n

* --- Measurements ---
.meas TRAN Vout_avg AVG V(3) FROM 100u TO 200u
.meas TRAN IL_avg  AVG I(L1) FROM 100u TO 200u
.meas TRAN Vripple PP  V(3)  FROM 100u TO 200u

.end
